From 245bfa77ee48e994271ea59a2a1483e7188a12bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port <port@local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:13:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/32] ASoC: qcom: sc8280xp: add SM6225 sound card

The sc8280xp machine driver in this tree is the generic
AudioReach/Q6APM machine driver used by QCM6490 and SM8450-family
boards. It does not hard-code a codec topology: it parses the
DT-described frontend/backend DAI links, registers the card with
the match-data string as the ALSA driver name and applies the
common SoundWire backend ops and WCD jack setup.

SM6225/Khaje is being modelled with the same AudioReach service
set (Q6APM/Q6PRM over GPR), LPASS RX/TX/VA macros, SoundWire and
a WCD937x codec, so allow the machine driver to bind to a
"qcom,sm6225-sndcard" node.

This only adds the compatible. The board description using it is
kept disabled: audio routing, speaker amplifiers, the exact
AudioReach topology and all runtime behaviour remain unverified
on hardware.

Signed-off-by: Port <port@local>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml | 1 +
 sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c                                | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
index b49a920af..4309fadc6 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
@@ -43,6 +43,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,sc7180-qdsp6-sndcard
           - qcom,sc8280xp-sndcard
           - qcom,sdm845-sndcard
+          - qcom,sm6225-sndcard
           - qcom,sm8250-sndcard
           - qcom,sm8450-sndcard
           - qcom,x1e80100-sndcard
diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
index 187f37ffe..8b24f26cd 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
@@ -198,6 +198,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id snd_sc8280xp_dt_match[] = {
 	{.compatible = "qcom,qcs9075-sndcard", "sa8775p"},
 	{.compatible = "qcom,qcs9100-sndcard", "sa8775p"},
 	{.compatible = "qcom,sc8280xp-sndcard", "sc8280xp"},
+	{.compatible = "qcom,sm6225-sndcard", "sm6225"},
 	{.compatible = "qcom,sm8450-sndcard", "sm8450"},
 	{.compatible = "qcom,sm8550-sndcard", "sm8550"},
 	{.compatible = "qcom,sm8650-sndcard", "sm8650"},
